00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:46.080
And he fell to temptation, huh?

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:53.330
Fixing matches is common for sumo gamblers.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:56.870
He's a boring man.

00:19:56.870 --> 00:20:02.160
How is trying to fix a match like
eating a fan's homemade snacks?

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.620
I don't know, how?

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:06.290
You might end up regretting it.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:10.080
That's all the time we have for today.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:18.120
